# built-in bento-slides skill (see that pack's templates/NOTICE.md for
# provenance). It is pinned by sha256 in
# internal/clientconfig/builtin_skills_bento_test.go, so any byte-level
# rewrite is a test failure:
#
#   -text   a contributor with core.autocrlf=true must not get CRLFs rewritten
#           into it on checkout — that would break the pinned digest.
#   -diff   it is a 689KB minified bundle; "Binary files differ" is the honest
#           presentation of a vendored blob in review, not a 689KB diff.
#   -merge  never attempt a content merge; re-vendor deliberately instead.
internal/clientconfig/builtin_skills/bento-slides/templates/*.bento.html -text -diff -merge
